## Interface: 120000, 120001, 120005, 120007, 120100
## Title: Gotta Queue 'Em All
## Notes: Larger Premade Groups window with docked sidebars for searching (filters, fit toggles, presets, season-best keys) and for starting a group (listing presets, your keystone, requirements, playstyle). Matches EllesmereUI's look when its Blizzard skin is active.
